    "id": 669248160086,
    "handle": "playroom-furniture",
    "title": "Playroom Furniture for Kids | Tables, Chairs & Storage",
    "body_html": "<h2>Playroom Furniture Built for Active Kids</h2>\n\n<p>Transform your play space with furniture designed specifically for children's activities. Our playroom furniture collection features sturdy tables, comfortable seating, and practical storage solutions that withstand daily use while keeping play areas organized.</p>\n\n<h3>Activity Tables and Play Surfaces</h3>\n<p>Playroom tables provide dedicated surfaces for crafts, puzzles, building blocks, and creative projects. Available in various sizes to fit different room dimensions and accommodate multiple children simultaneously.</p>\n\n<h3>Kids Seating and Chairs</h3>\n<p>Child-sized chairs and seating options offer proper support at the right height for young users. Lightweight designs allow children to move furniture independently while maintaining stability during use.</p>\n\n<h3>Toy Storage and Organization</h3>\n<p>Keep playrooms tidy with storage furniture including cube organizers, toy chests, and shelving units. Accessible designs encourage children to participate in cleanup while keeping toys visible and within reach.</p>\n\n<h3>Material and Safety Features</h3>\n<p>Playroom furniture uses durable materials resistant to scratches, stains, and moisture. Rounded edges, non-toxic finishes, and stable construction prioritize child safety during active play.</p>\n\n<h3>Sizing for Growing Children</h3>\n<p>Furniture dimensions accommodate toddlers through elementary-age children. Consider adjustable options or sets that grow with your child to maximize long-term use and value.</p>",
    "products_count": 3
  },
