      "id": 9841066639702,
      "title": "TodlerNest Cotton Cocoon Swing Chair - Portable Kids Hammock Pod",
      "body_html": "<h2>TodlerNest Hammock Pod Swing Chair – Premium Cocoon Design for Kids</h2><p>TodlerNest Hammock Pod Swing Chair brings together playful design and durable craftsmanship to create the ultimate relaxation and fun spot for kids. This thoughtfully designed cocoon swing is perfect for both indoor and outdoor use, giving children a safe and cozy space to rest, read, or play. With its portable and sturdy construction, it's an essential addition to modern family furniture, blending comfort and versatility with ease.</p><div style=\"text-align: left;\"><img src=\"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0886/4910/5750/files/1617183656300.jpg?v=1758635488\" alt=\"TodlerNest Hammock Pod Swing Chair – Portable Indoor &amp; Outdoor Hanging Seat, Cocoon Design for Children | Essential Garden Furniture &amp; Relaxation Swing for Kids\" style=\"float: none;\"></div><h3>Smart Design Features</h3><ul>\n<li>Cocoon-style design provides a safe, cozy, and enclosed space for children to relax.</li>\n<li>Portable and lightweight, easy to move between indoor and outdoor spaces.</li>\n<li>Durable cotton and polyester blend ensures strength and long-lasting use.</li>\n<li>Breathable fabric keeps seating cool and comfortable in any season.</li>\n<li>Strong suspension straps support safe hanging from ceilings, trees, or sturdy frames.</li>\n<li>Compact foldable design makes it travel-friendly and easy to store.</li>\n</ul><div style=\"text-align: left;\"><img src=\"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0886/4910/5750/files/1617183644413.jpg?v=1758635491\" alt=\"TodlerNest Hammock Pod Swing Chair – Portable Indoor &amp; Outdoor Hanging Seat, Cocoon Design for Children | Essential Garden Furniture &amp; Relaxation Swing for Kids\" style=\"float: none;\"></div><h3>Setup and Usage</h3><ul>\n<li>Securely attach swing using included straps and hooks to a sturdy ceiling beam, tree branch, or stand.</li>\n<li>Ensure the swing is properly balanced and anchored before use.</li>\n<li>Suitable for indoor playrooms, bedrooms, patios, or outdoor gardens.</li>\n<li>Gently wipe clean with a damp cloth as needed.</li>\n<li>Fold and store easily when not in use or for transport.</li>\n</ul><div style=\"text-align: left;\"><img src=\"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0886/4910/5750/files/1618563833144.jpg?v=1758635487\" alt=\"TodlerNest Hammock Pod Swing Chair – Portable Indoor &amp; Outdoor Hanging Seat, Cocoon Design for Children | Essential Garden Furniture &amp; Relaxation Swing for Kids\" style=\"float: none;\"></div><h3>Product Specifications</h3><ul>\n<li>Material: Premium cotton &amp; polyester fabric with reinforced stitching</li>\n<li>Dimensions: Approx. 150x70cm (varies slightly depending on suspension height)</li>\n<li>Style: Cocoon-style hanging hammock pod swing</li>\n<li>Colors: Available in vibrant child-friendly designs</li>\n<li>Suitable for: Children ages 3+ (with adult supervision)</li>\n<li>Package: 1 hammock pod swing chair with installation accessories</li>\n</ul><div style=\"text-align: left;\"><img src=\"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0886/4910/5750/files/1617183652918.jpg?v=1758635485\" alt=\"TodlerNest Hammock Pod Swing Chair – Portable Indoor &amp; Outdoor Hanging Seat, Cocoon Design for Children | Essential Garden Furniture &amp; Relaxation Swing for Kids\" style=\"float: none;\"></div><h3>Why Choose This Swing Chair</h3><p> </p><ul>\n<li> Perfect dual-use for indoor and outdoor relaxation.</li>\n<li>Provides a safe, cozy retreat for kids to play, nap, or read.</li>\n<li>Portable and lightweight for easy relocation and storage.</li>\n<li>Durable fabric construction designed for long-term everyday use.</li>\n<li>Adds a touch of fun and charm to gardens, patios, and children's rooms.</li>\n</ul><p><br></p><p style=\"text-align: center;\" align=\"center\" class=\"ql-align-center\"><span style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\"><strong>A Nestacular Promise</strong></span></p><p style=\"text-align: center;\" align=\"center\" class=\"ql-align-center\"><span style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\"><strong>At Nestacular, we believe in the quality of our products, so we offer a 30-day Money-Back Guarantee, no questions asked! When you purchase from us, there is ZERO Risk for you!</strong></span></p><p style=\"text-align: center;\" align=\"center\" class=\"ql-align-center\"><span style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\"><strong>Congratulations!</strong></span></p><p style=\"text-align: center;\" align=\"center\" class=\"ql-align-center\"><span style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\"><strong>You've found a hidden discount code! Use code \"TTD\" at checkout to claim an additional 10% OFF your ENTIRE order!</strong></span></p><p style=\"text-align: center;\" align=\"center\" class=\"ql-align-center\"> </p><p style=\"text-align: center;\" align=\"center\" class=\"ql-align-center\"><span style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\"><strong>Customer Support:</strong></span></p><p style=\"text-align: center;\" align=\"center\" class=\"ql-align-center\"><span style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\"><strong>Email: support@nestacular.com</strong></span></p>",
